        "TileImage": "$($repository 2e3a9f67-1a0e-4daf-a320-83c92a38a199).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning, 47. We have aquired the intel for your next targets.\r\rLisa Almestoy: Unassuming civilian at first. But she&apos;s actually a former ICA spy, trying to sell out what remains of the ICA database.\r\rSilvio Timeteo: A small-time criminal who specializes in stealing the parts off of motorbikes; give him a taste of vehicular  revenge.\r\rAgnese Pagnotta: Another unassuming target. However, she runs an antique shop, making trinkets out of human remains. Ghastly. Take her out, 47. Diana out.",
